is operative.</para></inform><limit layer="1" lid="N.00023743.0004001.015"><lit-limit lid="N.00023743.0004001.016"><abb>RNP</abb> 4 operations are not permitted.</lit-limit></limit><limit layer="1" lid="N.00023743.0004001.017"><lit-limit lid="N.00023743.0004001.018"><abb>RNP</abb> 2 operations are not permitted.</lit-limit></limit><limit layer="1" lid="N.00023743.0004001.019"><lit-limit lid="N.00023743.0004001.020"><abb>RNP</abb> 1 operations are not permitted.</lit-limit></limit><limit layer="1" lid="N.00023743.0004001.021"><lit-limit lid="N.00023743.0004001.022"><abb>RNP</abb> <abb>APCH</abb> operations are not permitted.</lit-limit></limit><limit layer="1" lid="N.00023743.0004001.023"><lit-limit lid="N.00023743.0004001.024">For aircraft
